From 34567ed5420d0845287ada4ded3ca58133cfc785 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ravonus <chadkoslovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:52:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add alpha cut-outs, text erase, ending loops and trailer
 lint

Let an agent direct a hero banner without hand-compositing:
- alpha sources (animated GIF/WebP/APNG with real transparency) composite as true cut-outs
- erase (rect / staticBright) removes baked-in captions where the art allows
- inside placement keeps a layer whole inside its box instead of cropping
- dissolve transition
- ending {kind: loop}: play the montage once, then render the final shot as a
  seamless loop (<name>-<target>-loop.mp4), with wrap and hand-over verification
- trailer-lint (CLI lint + MCP tool): cutoff, hard-edge, clipped and upscaled
  layers, with per-layer allow/check, exit 1 on errors

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md                     |   60 +-
 python/lint.py                |  108 ++
 python/montage.py             |   23 +
 python/renderer.py            |  129 +-
 python/worker.py              |    3 +
 schemas/timeline-v1.json      |  271 +++-
 schemas/tools.json            | 2477 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/cli.mjs                   |    7 +-
 src/index.d.ts                |   14 +-
 src/mcp.mjs                   |    1 +
 src/schema.mjs                |   53 +-
 test/layers-invariants.py     |   34 +
 test/make-montage-fixtures.py |   11 +
 test/mcp.test.mjs             |    4 +-
 test/montage.test.mjs         |   71 +
 15 files changed, 3169 insertions(+), 97 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 python/lint.py
 create mode 100644 test/layers-invariants.py

